#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:7
msgid "SMS-EMOA (S Metric Selection EMOA)"
msgstr "SMS-EMOA（S metric selection EMOA）"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"SMS-EMOA is a steady-state multi-objective evolutionary algorithm that "
"incorporates dominated hypervolume (the $\\mathcal{S}$ metric) directly "
"into the selection criterion. After splitting the population into fronts "
"via non-dominated sorting, it culls one individual at a time — the one "
"with the smallest hypervolume contribution within the lowest front — "
"monotonically increasing the population's overall dominated hypervolume "
"with each generation."
msgstr ""
"SMS-EMOAは、被支配超体積（$\\mathcal{S}$メトリック）を選択基準に直接組み込んだ、定常状態の多目的進化アルゴリズムです。 "
"非優越ソートで個体群をフロントに分割したうえで、最下位フロント内の超体積寄与度が最小の個体を1体ずつ淘汰し、世代を追うごとに個体群全体の被支配超体積を単調に増大させます。"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:12
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:14
msgid ""
"The hypervolume indicator is widely used as a measure of the quality of a"
" Pareto-front approximation. Fixing a reference point "
"$\\mathbf{y}_{\\mathrm{ref}}$ lets you define the Lebesgue measure "
"$\\mathcal{S}(B, \\mathbf{y}_{\\mathrm{ref}})$ of the region dominated by"
" a solution set $B$, and it is known that maximizing $\\mathcal{S}$ for a"
" finite Pareto-front approximation is equivalent to finding the true "
"Pareto set."
msgstr ""
"超体積指標は、パレートフロント近似の質を測る指標として広く使われています。 "
"基準点$\\mathbf{y}_{\\mathrm{ref}}$を1つ固定すると、解集合$B$が支配する領域のルベーグ測度$\\mathcal{S}(B,"
" "
"\\mathbf{y}_{\\mathrm{ref}})$が定義でき、有限のパレートフロント近似において$\\mathcal{S}$を最大化することが真のパレート集合を求めることと等価になることが知られています。"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:17
msgid ""
"SMS-EMOA doesn't stop at using this hypervolume indicator for evaluation "
"— it adopts it as the selection operator itself. Using the same **non-"
"dominated sorting** as NSGA-II, it splits the population into fronts "
"$\\mathcal{R}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{R}_v$, and within the lowest front "
"$\\mathcal{R}_v$, culls the single individual whose removal causes the "
"smallest decrease in the $\\mathcal{S}$ metric. This decrease is called "
"the **exclusive hypervolume contribution**, $\\Delta_{\\mathcal{S}}(s, "
"\\mathcal{R}_v) := \\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v) - "
"\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v \\setminus \\{s\\})$."
msgstr ""
"SMS-EMOAは、この超体積指標を評価用途にとどめず、選択演算子そのものに採用します。 NSGA-"
"IIと同じ**非優越ソート**で個体群をフロント$\\mathcal{R}_1, \\ldots, "
"\\mathcal{R}_v$に分割し、最下位フロント$\\mathcal{R}_v$の中で、除いたときに$\\mathcal{S}$メトリックの減少量が最小となる個体を1体だけ淘汰します。"
" この減少量を**排他的超体積寄与度** $\\Delta_{\\mathcal{S}}(s, \\mathcal{R}_v) := "
"\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v) - \\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v \\setminus "
"\\{s\\})$と呼びます。"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:21
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Because hypervolume computation is expensive, SMS-EMOA uses **steady-"
"state** generational replacement. Each generation generates only a single"
" new individual via crossover and mutation, and culls a single existing "
"individual to keep the population size $\\mu$ constant. This avoids "
"having to compare $\\binom{\\mu+\\lambda}{\\mu}$ combinations as in "
"$(\\mu+\\lambda)$ generational replacement, keeping $\\mathcal{S}$-metric"
" evaluations within the lowest front to at most $\\mu+1$."
msgstr ""
"超体積の計算コストが高いため、SMS-EMOAは**定常状態**の世代交代を採ります。 "
"1世代につき交叉と突然変異で新個体を1体だけ生成し、個体群サイズ$\\mu$を保つために既存個体を1体だけ淘汰します。 "
"$(\\mu+\\lambda)$世代交代のように$\\binom{\\mu+\\lambda}{\\mu}$通りの組み合わせを比較する必要がなく、最下位フロント内で高々$\\mu+1$回の$\\mathcal{S}$メトリック評価に抑えられます。"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The source is {cite}`beume2007smsemoa`. The concrete procedure is shown "
"in the pseudocode below."
msgstr "出典は{cite}`beume2007smsemoa`。具体的な手順は次の擬似コードに示します。"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:27
msgid "Pseudocode"
msgstr "擬似コード"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:29
msgid "(SMS-EMOA)"
msgstr "式: (SMS-EMOA)"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:32
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Inputs** objective functions, population size $\\mu$, initial "
"population $P_0$ **Output** the population $P_{t+1}$ of the final "
"generation"
msgstr "**Inputs** 目的関数群、個体数 $\\mu$、初期個体群 $P_0$ **Output** 最終世代の個体群 $P_{t+1}$"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:35
msgid "Set $t=0$; generate an initial population $P_0$ of $\\mu$ individuals"
msgstr "$t=0$ とし、$\\mu$ 個体からなる初期個体群 $P_0$ を生成する"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:36
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Generate a single new individual $q_{t+1}$ from $P_t$ via crossover and "
"mutation"
msgstr "交叉と突然変異により、$P_t$ から新個体 $q_{t+1}$ を1体だけ生成する"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:37
msgid ""
"Non-dominated-sort $Q = P_t \\cup \\{q_{t+1}\\}$ (size $\\mu+1$) to "
"obtain the front sequence $\\mathcal{R}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{R}_v$"
msgstr ""
"$Q = P_t \\cup \\{q_{t+1}\\}$（サイズ $\\mu+1$）を非優越ソートし、フロント列 "
"$\\mathcal{R}_1, \\ldots, \\mathcal{R}_v$ を得る"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Identify the lowest front $\\mathcal{R}_v$ (if $|\\mathcal{R}_v|=1$, that"
" single individual is the one to be culled)"
msgstr "最下位フロント $\\mathcal{R}_v$ を特定する（$|\\mathcal{R}_v|=1$ ならその1個体がそのまま淘汰対象になる）"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:39
msgid ""
"If $|\\mathcal{R}_v| > 1$, compute the exclusive hypervolume contribution"
" $\\Delta_{\\mathcal{S}}(s, \\mathcal{R}_v) = "
"\\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v) - \\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v \\setminus "
"\\{s\\})$ for each individual $s$ in $\\mathcal{R}_v$, and choose the "
"individual $r$ with the smallest value"
msgstr ""
"$|\\mathcal{R}_v| > 1$ のとき、$\\mathcal{R}_v$ 内の各個体 $s$ について排他的超体積寄与度 "
"$\\Delta_{\\mathcal{S}}(s, \\mathcal{R}_v) = \\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v)"
" - \\mathcal{S}(\\mathcal{R}_v \\setminus \\{s\\})$ を計算し、最小の個体 $r$ を選ぶ"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Set $P_{t+1} = Q \\setminus \\{r\\}$ (which always satisfies "
"$\\mathcal{S}(P_t) \\leq \\mathcal{S}(P_{t+1})$)"
msgstr ""
"$P_{t+1} = Q \\setminus \\{r\\}$ とする（$\\mathcal{S}(P_t) \\leq "
"\\mathcal{S}(P_{t+1})$ が常に成り立つ）"

#: ../../algorithms/sms_emoa.md:41
msgid ""
"Set $t=t+1$ and return to step 2, repeating until the termination "
"condition is reached"
msgstr "$t=t+1$ として2へ戻り、終了条件に達するまで繰り返す"

